","kind":"person","person_id":"qlm_m3s_f3b_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m044-0042","start":42,"end":43,"surface":"女","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m044-0053","start":53,"end":56,"surface":"楚平王","kind":"person","person_id":"qlm_m3s_f3b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m044-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"建","kind":"person","person_id":"qlm_m3s_f3b_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m044-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"建","kind":"person","person_id":"qlm_m3s_f3b_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m044-0063","start":63,"end":66,"surface":"伍子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"kk7_tis_vis","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m044-0097","start":97,"end":101,"surface":"吳王闔閭","kind":"person","person_id":"5dm_e40_rqh_AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m044-0102","start":102,"end":105,"surface":"伍子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"kk7_tis_vis","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m044-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"楚王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m044-0119","start":119,"end":122,"surface":"楚大夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m044-0122","start":122,"end":125,"surface":"申包胥","kind":"person","person_id":"0rc_0ya_wg8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m044-0158","start":158,"end":161,"surface":"楚昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"9gq_tfb_414","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m044-0167","start":167,"end":169,"surface":"哀公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m044-0176","start":176,"end":180,